# RDF Unreleased Release Notes

## Unreleased

-- New Features --

[New] rdf account default <name>|-: store the account the rdf shell init launchers use when
      neither @name nor cuse picks one; list shows it, '-' clears it, and removing that
      account clears it
[New] rdf account primary <name> [--dry-run]: move <name>'s login, .claude.json, plugins and
      org-managed settings into ~/.claude and the current primary's to ~/.claude-<old>;
      shared state stays put, plugin paths are rewritten, and any failed move is undone;
      it refuses while Claude Code or its daemon runs, on symlinked entries, and on macOS
      (keychain logins)

-- Bug Fixes --

[Fix] bash 3.2 (macOS system bash) under set -e exits on a failing 'command <x>' even inside if
      or ||, so the context-audit script died silently at its GNU find -printf probe on BSD
      find; that probe, _rdf_atomic_write's cleanup path, two rdf-bus mkdirs and rdf migrate's
      cp fallbacks now run in a subshell, and macOS CI smokes context-audit under /bin/bash
[Fix] CI Plugin job failed on every push: newer Claude Code validators warn that CLAUDE.md
      at the plugin root is not loaded as project context (RDF's repo root is the plugin
      root), and --strict made that fatal; the step now reads the --json report and fails
      on any error or any other warning

-- Changes --

[Change] docs: the quickstart covers the shell launchers and multiple accounts and the Pages
         home points to it; em dashes swept from the docs, changelog and release names;
         /r-ship and the triage ledger use "## X.Y (date)" headers
